### Delete hero by id (LOCAL)
DELETE http://localhost:3000/api/heroes/{HERO_ID}
Accept: application/json

### Delete hero by id (RENDER)
DELETE https://starwars-p3bg.onrender.com/api/heroes/{HERO_ID}
Accept: application/json